  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen you are in a lot of Groups the list of Groups when creating a Group Instance or Inviting someone to a Group can get really long. The problem with this is that these selection menus don't have a scrollbar. This makes it harder to scroll through the bottom of the list and so on.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nWhen a list of Groups get show to a user for either inviting someone or creating an instance, there should be scrollbar on the side of it. to make it more clear that it's a scrollable list.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere are pictures showcasing the issue:",
